[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0330","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0330.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0869","title":"Cyrus SASL 格式字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Cyrus SASL 库 common.c 文件中的默认日志回调函数 _sasl_syslog 存在格式字符串漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的日志数据包利用该漏洞执行任意命令。该漏洞影响广泛的 Cyrus SASL 库用户，攻击者无需身份验证即可远程触发，威胁等级极高。Cyrus SASL 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0869"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-21T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:08Z","remediation":"升级 Cyrus SASL 库至 2.1.8 或更高版本（修复了 _sasl_syslog 中的格式化字符串漏洞），或升级到厂商提供的修复版本（如 Cyrus SASL 2.1.10+）。若无法立即升级，可通过配置 syslog 禁用 SASL 认证日志记录功能作为临时缓解措施，或在防火墙层面限制 SASL 服务的网络访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000444","http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:018","http://lwn.net/alerts/SuSE/SuSE-SA%3A2001%3A042.php3","http://www.caldera.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-040.0.txt","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-150.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-151.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3498","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7443","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0869.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0869","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0869.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0869.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-qjxx-h2x5-mvmp/GHSA-qjxx-h2x5-mvmp.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0869.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151900_152000.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2002-018.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0869.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0330.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0398","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0398.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0876","title":"Microsoft Windows UPnP NOTIFY 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"CVE-2001-0876是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0876"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-20T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:09Z","remediation":"标签中。<value>安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-059 对应补丁：Windows XP 用户安装 Q315000 补丁（该修复后续包含于 Windows XP Service Pack 1），Windows 98/98SE 用户安装 Q314941 补丁，Windows ME 用户安装 Q314757 补丁，可通过 Windows Update 或 Microsoft Download Center 下载安装。如暂时无法安装补丁，请在防火墙中阻断 UDP 1900 和 5000 端口，并禁用 SSDP Discovery Service 与 Universal Plug and Play 组件以临时降低远程利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100887440810532&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=100887271006313&w=2","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-37.html","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/m-030.shtml","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/951555","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3723","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-059","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7721","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21189","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dbab824db2d42b734971c1b87553018066aa35d2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0876.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0876","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beabc13489602b94b6c532f1aa3931e9e9fc2bc0/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0876.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6a16668a1632a04fd23488d1308b95bb656fd69/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0876.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/upnp_xp_tcp.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/458762a518138a26e597ac195eb82ce6c30238eb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fxhg-8327-3c3x/GHSA-fxhg-8327-3c3x.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/smb_xp_ms01-059.nasl","https://github.com/gadievron/raptor/blob/91a96868b7c8ed9925661943b06d85609640f622/packages/cve_diff/data/samples/random_200_full_v3.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0398.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0341","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0341.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0889","title":"Exim 邮件服务器 代码执行漏洞","description":"Exim 3.22 及更早版本在特定配置下存在命令注入漏洞。当邮件系统配置将邮件地址重定向到管道处理时，Exim 未能正确验证邮件地址的本地部分，导致远程攻击者可通过构造包含 Shell 元字符（如反引号、分号、管道符等）的恶意邮件地址，实现任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 Exim 3.22 及更早版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需认证，可导致机密性、完整性、可用性部分受损。攻击者可通过发送特制邮件触发漏洞，在服务器上下文执行任意 Shell 命令，进而完全控制邮件服务器。建议升级至 Exim 3.23 或更高版本，或禁用管道重定向功能。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0889"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:09Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Exim 至 3.23 或更高版本（如 4.x 稳定版），该版本修复了管道地址本地部分验证缺陷。若暂时无法升级，请在 Exim 配置文件中禁用 pipe 传输（注释或删除 transport/pipe 配置段），或在路由器配置中禁止 address_pipe 选项，防止远程攻击者通过 shell 元字符注入任意命令。同时建议在邮件网关层面部署邮件内容过滤规则，拦截包含管道字符（|）的异常地址作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100877978506387&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-097","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/283723","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-176.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3728","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7738","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0889.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0889","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0889.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/80dda50d8d5f7811125252929942fe793daf4c0a/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0889.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5432-vj89-rgm6/GHSA-5432-vj89-rgm6.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0889.md","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/c071ecf55c75d9da4d25f2554f790d734c763312/data/anchore/2001/CVE-2001-0889.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151900_152000.json","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/2008/deb_097_1.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/72eb3babf4053f474a6fa1578cb387378535ac53/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0341.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0490","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0490.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1212","title":"Aktivate Shopping Cart catgy.cgi 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Aktivate 1.03 购物车系统的 catgy.cgi 脚本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，由于对 desc 参数缺乏充分的输入验证和输出编码，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的 HTTP 请求，在受害者浏览器中执行任意脚本，可能导致会话 Cookie 窃取、页面内容篡改或钓鱼攻击。该漏洞影响 Aktivate 1.03 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，攻击复杂度低，仅需网络访问即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1212"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-18T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:49Z","remediation":"对 catgy.cgi 的 desc 参数进行严格的输入过滤和输出编码，过滤所有 HTML/JavaScript 特殊字符（如 < > \" ' &），或直接删除 desc 参数中的脚本标签。由于 Aktivate 1.03 已停止维护且无官方补丁，建议立即迁移至仍在维护的购物车系统（如 Magento 或 WooCommerce），并在迁移完成前使用 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）拦截包含 <script> 等恶意标签的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7717.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/246274","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3714","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21187","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1212.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1212","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1212.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1212.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5m3q-2862-r78p/GHSA-5m3q-2862-r78p.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/dangerous_cgis.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1212.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x4000/3714/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e4ebc78a-0ced-4d6c-9f24-277a340a9bee.json","https://github.com/7RU7H/CTFs/blob/dc835283b6e68fb380c3831f986baee50e6ab88a/OS-ProvingGrounds/Kevin/nikto.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0490.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0484","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0484.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1196","title":"Webmin 0.91 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Webmin 0.91 的 edit_action.cgi 脚本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过在参数中插入 `..`（点点）序列来突破路径限制，访问服务器上任意文件。该漏洞可导致攻击者读取系统敏感文件（如 /etc/passwd）甚至获取服务器完全控制权限，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。官方已发布修复版本，建议升级至 Webmin 0.92 或更高版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1196"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:47Z","remediation":"立即升级 Webmin 至 1.0 或更高版本，该漏洞在后续版本中已修复目录遍历问题。如无法升级，可在 Webmin 配置中禁用 edit_action.cgi 脚本的执行权限，或通过 Web 服务器访问控制限制对 /cgi-bin/edit_action.cgi 路径的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=webmin-l&m=100865390306103&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7711.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/245980","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3698","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21183","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1196.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1196","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1196.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98f785d4de3da29b2a31131d1ba99ceeb9ee0484/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1196.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w4xr-29hm-4mxw/GHSA-w4xr-29hm-4mxw.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/dangerous_cgis.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1196.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x4000/3698/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151900_152000.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/W/webmin_0_91_dir_traversal.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0484.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0485","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0485.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1199","title":"Steve Kneizys Agora.CGI 调试模式跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Agora.CGI 3.x/4.0 的 Debug 调试模式中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 `agora.cgi` 脚本的特定参数注入恶意脚本代码，当管理员或用户访问包含恶意载荷的页面时，脚本将在浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或钓鱼攻击。该漏洞影响 Agora.CGI 3.x 及 4.0 版本，攻击条件为服务器启用了 Debug 调试模式，无需身份认证即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1199"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-17T00:00:00Z","updated":"2001-12-17T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到 Agora 4.0g 及以上版本，该漏洞已在后续版本修复。同时在生产环境中务必关闭 Debug Mode（设置 debug=0），避免攻击者通过 cart_id 参数注入恶意脚本。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器层面对 cart_id 参数进行 HTML 编码过滤，或限制只有受信 IP 可访问 agora.cgi。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21184","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1199.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1199","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1199.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/agora.nasl","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98f785d4de3da29b2a31131d1ba99ceeb9ee0484/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1199.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4w53-cpmg-rg5c/GHSA-4w53-cpmg-rg5c.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1199.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151900_152000.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1199.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/agora.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0485.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0485.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0485.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0483","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0483.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1195","title":"Novell GroupWise 5.5/6.0 Servlet Gateway 默认身份认证漏洞","description":"Novell Groupwise 5.5 及 6.0 版本的 Servlet Gateway 组件在安装时使用默认的用户名和密码配置 Servlet Manager 管理接口，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过该默认凭据直接登录管理后台，获取系统控制权限。攻击者可进一步利用管理接口上传恶意 Servlet 或修改配置，实现完全接管目标服务器。该漏洞影响范围广泛，利用门槛极低，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1195"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-15T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:47Z","remediation":"立即修改 Servlet Manager 的默认用户名和密码，默认凭据为 servlet/manager，可通过访问 /servlet/ServletManager 路径进行更改。同时配置 Web 服务器访问控制，限制仅允许受信任 IP 访问 Servlet Manager 管理界面。由于 Novell Groupwise 5.5/6.0 已停止支持，建议升级到受支持的 Groupwise 版本或迁移至替代产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.novell.com/cgi-bin/search/searchtid.cgi?/10067329.htm","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7701.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/245871","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3697","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21182","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1195.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1195","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1195.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98f785d4de3da29b2a31131d1ba99ceeb9ee0484/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1195.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-947r-gfv7-4ww7/GHSA-947r-gfv7-4ww7.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1195.md","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/novell_groupwise_servletmanager_default_password.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x4000/3697/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1195.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151900_152000.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0483.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0482","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0482.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1194","title":"ZyXEL Prestige 681/1600 SDSL 路由器 IP 分片重组拒绝服务漏洞","description":"ZyXEL Prestige 681 和 1600 SDSL 路由器在处理畸形 IP 数据包时存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可通过两种方式触发：一是发送 IP 头部声明的长度小于实际数据包大小的畸形报文，二是发送分片重组后总大小超过 64KB 的畸形分片包。当路由器处理这些异常数据包时，IP 分片重组模块出现逻辑错误，导致设备崩溃或重启，无法正常提供网络服务。该漏洞影响 ZyXEL Prestige 681 和 1600 系列 SDSL 路由器，攻击者只需向目标路由器发送特制网络报文即可实施攻击，无需任何身份认证。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1194"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:47Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停产二十余年的 Zyxel Prestige 681/1600 SDSL 路由器，厂商未发布任何补丁。建议立即将设备更换为受支持的现代型号；若无法更换，可在上游防火墙配置规则丢弃入站的分片 IP 包（如 iptables -A INPUT -f -j DROP），或限制 DSL 接口上分片包的重组缓冲区大小以缓解 DoS 风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-12/0140.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-12/0190.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3695","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7704","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21186","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1194.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1194","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1194.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98f785d4de3da29b2a31131d1ba99ceeb9ee0484/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1194.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2xmv-96h9-88qv/GHSA-2xmv-96h9-88qv.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1194.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x4000/3695/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1194.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--699367f3-1e4c-43bd-acfc-1c9ba6c001e7.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/14bb986e846fe12089d9a0db6d36001bfb343b78/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0482.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0358","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0358.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0797","title":"Solaris /bin/login 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"System V 衍生操作系统的 `/bin/login` 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 telnet、rlogin 等远程登录服务，向目标系统传入大量额外参数触发该溢出，进而在目标系统上执行任意命令并完全控制主机。该漏洞影响基于 System V 的多种操作系统版本（包括 Solaris 2.5.1/2.6/7/8 等），攻击者无需任何凭据即可从网络发起利用。CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级为严重，Metasploit 等工具已公开相关利用模块。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0797"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:58Z","remediation":"对于运行 Solaris 2.5.1/2.6/7/8 的 SPARC 架构系统，立即升级到 Solaris 8 Update 1 或更高版本以修复 /bin/login 中的缓冲区溢出漏洞。若无法立即升级，请在系统上禁用 telnet 和 rlogin 服务（通过 /etc/inetd.conf 注释掉相关行并重启 inetd），仅允许使用 SSH 协议进行远程登录。对于无法停用的服务，可在网络边界防火墙处限制源 IP 地址，仅允许受信任的主机访问 telnet/rlogin 端口（23/513）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100844757228307&w=2","http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/213","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY26221&apar=only","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-34.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/569272","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/246487","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3681","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise105.php","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7284","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A2025","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/10036","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2001/CVE-2001-0797.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7bafe961419ed00378435555d77a3a118a4791ff/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0797.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0797","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/Kicksecure/security-misc/blob/7f55b21b018a8133a2ab5cc82bc5145caa8f0174/README.md","https://github.com/0xdea/exploits/blob/7577132dfcc4ac851bc8319b5d96d86f939d7380/solaris/raptor_rlogin.c","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/remote-exploits/8490.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/812e13284092701ac2e48a9865618a02a3b2d95e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-5vwx-44rv-q6c2/GHSA-5vwx-44rv-q6c2.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ttyprompt.nasl","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/b3f812bd4b5f3ade59f8b9defed21f6c3f9dab55/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0797.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0358.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0481","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0481.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1188","title":"Brian Dorricott MAILTO 未经授权邮件服务器使用漏洞","description":"Brian Dorricott MAILTO 的 mailto.exe 程序（1.0.9 及更早版本）存在隐藏表单字段可被恶意修改的安全漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过修改 sendto、email、server、subject 及 resulturl 等隐藏表单字段的值，利用该程序作为邮件中继代理发送垃圾邮件。该漏洞影响 MAILTO 1.0.9 及之前所有版本，攻击者只需构造特制的 HTTP 请求即可利用，攻击门槛低，可导致邮件服务器被滥用、垃圾邮件泛滥及信息泄露。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1188"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:46Z","remediation":"立即删除或禁用服务器上的 mailto.exe CGI 脚本，该软件已停止维护且无安全更新可用。如业务需要表单转邮件功能，改用支持服务器端参数校验的现代邮件网关组件，并对 SMTP 服务器启用身份认证和发送频率限制。作为临时缓解措施，在 Web 服务器配置中限制 mailto.exe 的执行权限，仅允许受信来源 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/244909","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3669","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21178","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1188.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1188","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1188.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98f785d4de3da29b2a31131d1ba99ceeb9ee0484/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1188.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wc45-wmxx-7883/GHSA-wc45-wmxx-7883.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1188.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151900_152000.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--10734ec7-98d3-4986-83a1-af163be6f0e1.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2001-1188.json","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0481.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0481.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0481.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0480","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0480.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1186","title":"Microsoft IIS 5.0 Content-Length 字段拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 5.0 存在 Content-Length 字段处理不当导致的拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求，其中 Content-Length 值被设置为远大于实际请求体大小的数值，导致 IIS 无法正常超时关闭该连接，从而耗尽服务器连接池资源，造成后续正常请求无法被处理。该漏洞影响 Microsoft IIS 5.0 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程触发，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。利用方式简单，已有公开 PoC 代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1186"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:45Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2001 年 8 月发布的 IIS 5.0 累积安全更新 (MS01-044)，该补丁修复了虚假 Content-Length 导致的拒绝服务问题。对于仍运行 Windows 2000 的系统，建议升级至受支持的操作系统版本（如 Windows Server 2019/2022）及对应 IIS 版本。如无法升级，可在 IIS 管理器中禁用不必要的 HTTP 扩展功能，并在网络边界防火墙配置连接速率限制和超时策略以缓解攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/244931","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/245100","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7691.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/244892","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3667","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21177","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1186.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1186","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1186.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1186.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9wgj-g8wc-6p76/GHSA-9wgj-g8wc-6p76.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/1xxx/cve-2001-1186.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1186.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_700_800.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-130.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1186.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0480.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0480.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0480.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0343","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0343.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0890","title":"SANE 后端驱动 不安全临时文件创建漏洞","description":"SANE 扫描仪访问库 1.0.3 及更早版本的某些后端驱动程序存在不安全的临时文件创建漏洞。前端软件（如 XSane）在使用这些后端驱动时，会在创建临时文件时未进行安全检查，导致本地攻击者可通过符号链接攻击修改任意文件。攻击者需具备本地访问权限，利用竞争条件在临时文件创建前建立指向敏感文件的符号链接，从而实现任意文件修改。该漏洞影响使用 SANE 1.0.3 及早期版本的扫描软件，CVSS 评分 2.1（本地访问/低复杂度/部分完整性影响），危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0890"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:10Z","remediation":"建议升级 SANE 库至 1.0.4 或更高版本（该版本修复了后端驱动程序中临时文件的符号链接攻击漏洞）。若暂时无法升级，可通过设置安全的临时文件目录权限（如设置 sticky bit：chmod +t /tmp）或配置 SANE 后端使用专用、权限受限的临时目录来缓解符号链接攻击风险。同时建议限制本地用户对扫描服务的访问权限，降低本地提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2001-171.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7714.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3987","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0890.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0890","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0890.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/80dda50d8d5f7811125252929942fe793daf4c0a/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0890.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hhh8-m9xh-rhqw/GHSA-hhh8-m9xh-rhqw.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0890.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0890.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--9dae9d0f-cfb5-4dfd-a857-94f8b4a3b117.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/72eb3babf4053f474a6fa1578cb387378535ac53/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0343.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0479","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0479.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1185","title":"FreeBSD 4.4 AIO 库跨进程内存写入本地权限提升漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 4.4 的 AIO（异步 I/O）库存在跨进程内存写入漏洞。当某些 AIO 操作在调用 execve 系统调用后仍被延迟执行时，本地攻击者可以利用这一时间差，通过精心构造的 AIO 请求覆盖新进程的内存空间，从而劫持进程执行流并提升权限。该漏洞需要本地访问权限且利用复杂度较高，但成功利用后可完全控制受影响的系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1185"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-10T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:45Z","remediation":"升级至 FreeBSD 4.5 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 FreeBSD 4.5-RELEASE 中修复。如无法升级，可通过在内核配置中禁用 AIO 支持（options NO_AIO）并重新编译内核来缓解风险。对于仍在运行 FreeBSD 4.x 的系统，强烈建议迁移至受支持的 FreeBSD 版本（如 13.x 或 14.x）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7693.php","http://www.osvdb.org/2001","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/244583","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3661","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21176","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1185.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1185","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1185.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1185.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-444h-fpxc-vh3q/GHSA-444h-fpxc-vh3q.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1185.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1185.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2875c381-f416-4a20-b5bc-43d58001734d.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0479.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0478","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0478.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1184","title":"Denicomp Winsock RSHD/NT 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Denicomp Winsock RSHD/NT 中的 wrshdsp.exe 服务进程存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标系统发送特制的端口号参数触发该漏洞：在 2.20.00 及更早版本中，传递负数等无效端口号会导致服务进程尝试连接该端口及 1024 以下所有端口，造成 CPU 资源耗尽；在 2.21.00 版本中，传递端口号 1024 同样会触发 CPU 过度消耗。攻击者只需具备网络访问能力即可实施攻击，导致目标服务不可用，影响系统正常运行。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1184"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-08T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:44Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Denicomp Winsock RSHD/NT 升级至 2.24.01 或更高版本（厂商官网已发布修复版本）。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙层面限制对 TCP 514 端口的访问，仅允许受信任的源 IP 连接；同时在服务配置中禁用不必要的 rsh 功能，并通过主机等价表严格限制可访问的远程用户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/245405","http://www.denicomp.com/rshdnt.htm","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7694.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/244580","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3659","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21175","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2001/CVE-2001-1184.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1184.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1184","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1184.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-1184.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m44g-7pj4-2chg/GHSA-m44g-7pj4-2chg.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151900_152000.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1184.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0478.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0425","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0425.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0952","title":"THQ Volition Red Faction 游戏服务器/客户端拒绝服务漏洞","description":"THQ Volition 开发的 Red Faction 游戏服务端与客户端存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可向目标主机的 UDP 7755 端口发送特制数据包，导致游戏服务端或客户端进程崩溃挂起，无法正常提供服务。攻击条件简单，仅需知道目标 IP 地址即可发起攻击，使用 nmap 等工具发送 UDP 探测包即可触发该漏洞。该漏洞影响 Red Faction 1.0 及 1.1 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0952"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-07T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:17Z","remediation":"在防火墙或路由器层面阻止 UDP 端口 7755 的入站流量，防止外部攻击者向游戏服务器/客户端发送恶意数据包。如使用软件防火墙（如 Windows 防火墙），添加入站规则禁止 UDP 7755 端口。建议升级到厂商已修复的最新版本（如有），或停止使用该版本游戏服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100774266027774&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3651","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7672","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21170","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0952.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0952","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/11a92cc3c0d31b9e78fe8f2a857dd04df3195701/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0952.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0952.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-67h3-8qvv-wcm5/GHSA-67h3-8qvv-wcm5.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa7